---
layout: null
---
<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<urlset xmlns="http://www.sitemaps.org/schemas/sitemap/0.9" xmlns:xhtml="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
{%- comment -%} Fixed pages. Add a new page to this list when you create one. The home page ("/") is NOT here since 11.38, `/license.html` and `/privacy.html` (11.58) and "/streams.html" (11.44) "/releases.html" (11.45) and "/photo.html" (11.46) are NOT here: they have `ref` and are listed by the group loop below. {%- endcomment -%}
{%- comment -%} Biographies: one entry per language file in the folder _bio, each one lists all language versions (hreflang, include i18n-alternates.html). {%- endcomment -%}
{%- for item in site.bio %}
    <url>
        <loc>{{ item.url | absolute_url | xml_escape }}</loc>
        {%- include i18n-alternates.html ref="bio" mode="sitemap" %}
    </url>
{%- endfor %}
{%- comment -%}
  Pages of translation groups (front matter `ref`, v11.30). Each one lists all READY versions. When an English fixed page gets a `ref`,
  take it out of the list `fixed_pages` above, or it is listed twice. Pages with `i18n_ready: false` are skipped.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- for item in site.pages %}
{%- if item.ref and item.ref != "" and item.i18n_ready != false %}
    <url>
        <loc>{{ item.url | absolute_url | xml_escape }}</loc>
        {%- include i18n-alternates.html ref=item.ref mode="sitemap" %}
    </url>
{%- endif %}
{%- endfor %}
{%- comment -%} News articles. Entries that point to an old page use that old address. {%- endcomment -%}
{%- for post in site.posts %}
    <url>
        <loc>{{ post.legacy_url | default: post.url | uri_escape | absolute_url | xml_escape }}</loc>
        {%- if post.updated and post.updated != "" %}
        <lastmod>{{ post.updated | date_to_xmlschema }}</lastmod>
        {%- endif %}
        {%- include i18n-alternates.html ref=post.slug mode="sitemap" %}
    </url>
{%- endfor %}
{%- comment -%} Translated news articles (collection news_tr, v11.50): only ready ones. Their hreflang group = the slug of the English post (i18n-alternates.html, v11.52). {%- endcomment -%}
{%- for item in site.news_tr %}
{%- unless item.i18n_ready == false %}
    <url>
        <loc>{{ item.url | uri_escape | absolute_url | xml_escape }}</loc>
        {%- include i18n-alternates.html ref=item.ref mode="sitemap" %}
    </url>
{%- endunless %}
{%- endfor %}
{%- comment -%} Song lyrics pages (folder "lyrics", layout "lyrics"). {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign sm_lyrics = site.pages | where: "layout", "lyrics" -%}
{%- for item in sm_lyrics %}
    <url><loc>{{ item.url | absolute_url | xml_escape }}</loc></url>
{%- endfor %}
</urlset>
